---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="backdrop-blur-md bg-white/5 border-t border-white/10 py-12 mt-auto">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8">
            <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-4">Sovereign Life OS</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
                    Transformă-ți casa într-un ecosistem inteligent și privat.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-4">Linkuri</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
                    <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Documentație</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">GitHub</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-4">Confidențialitate</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
                    Datele tale nu părăsesc niciodată rețeaua locală.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4">
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">© {year} Sovereign Life OS. Toate drepturile rezervate.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
